    "1": {
      "date": "2026-11-04",
      "text": "End-to-end run of the eight original types (all except sequence) in a clean install, before later fixes to the skill. Result: 8 of 8 with the gate at 0."
    },
    "2": {
      "date": "2026-11-06",
      "text": "One run per cell, before the visual theme of this repository. The gate and the layout scripts were the same; only colors, fonts and names changed afterwards."
    },
    "3": {
      "date": "2026-11-06",
      "text": "On this repository under its previous name, Claude Code 2.1.318, before the state machine, C4 and color tokens were added. Poster: one frame ends about 8 px past the right margin (5 gate calls, 5 min 34 s, US$0.53). Sequence: 7 gate calls, 2 rejected and then fixed (6 min 12 s, US$0.41). Before the theme change, the same model also passed both types."
    },
    "4": {
      "date": "2026-11-04",
      "text": "Codex CLI was not measured on this repository. Before the theme change, one poster run passed the gate (2026-11-04); its PNG was not re-read."
    },
    "5": {
      "date": null,
      "text": "Kiro round 2, before later fixes to the skill. Poster, step flow and cards were not run again after those fixes: the account hit the request limit."
    },
    "6": {
      "date": "2026-11-06",
      "text": "One run. The gate returned 0, but two-line labels sat far from their arrow. The generator was fixed and the PNG regenerated from the same spec; the model was not run again."
    },
    "7": {
      "date": "2026-11-06",
      "text": "Sonnet 4.5, three runs: the first delivered a PNG without CSS, the second passed the gate of the time with arrows starting inside boxes and a loose label (that source became the negative test tests/negative/c4-arrows.html), the third passed the new gate but one arrow reached the wrong system. Opus 5.5, one run: gate 0 and a clean PNG, 11 relations, all to the right target. It is the result in examples/c4/output/."
    }
  },
